  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Co-operation through Swedish Chambers of Commerce. If the evaluation shows that the local organizations have capacity to support the local commerce and industry, the evaluation will prepare proposal for a programme design for continued co-operation between the Chambers.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av samarbetet genom Handelskammaren. Om utv&#xe4;rderingen visar att de lokala organisationerna bed&#xf6;ms ha kapacitet att st&#xf6;dja den lokala handeln och industrin ska utv&#xe4;rderingen l&#xe4;mna f&#xf6;rslag till programdesign f&#xf6;r fortsatt st&#xf6;d till Handelskammarsamarbeten.</narrative>
